  <h1>You're in. Welcome, founding member.</h1>

  <p class="subtitle">Your enrollment is confirmed. Your login is on its way - and your Toolkit is already live.</p>

  <div class="next-steps">
    <p class="next-steps-heading">Next Steps</p>

    <div class="step">
      <span class="step-num">1</span>
      <p class="step-text"><strong>Check your email.</strong> Your login link is on the way - usually within 2 minutes. Look for "Welcome to The Zero Fog" in your inbox. If it's not there in 5 minutes, check Promotions or Spam and move it to your main inbox.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <span class="step-num">2</span>
      <p class="step-text"><strong>Start with Module 0.</strong> Three short lessons, about twenty minutes. Sets the frame for everything that follows. Module 0 and Week 1 are open from day one - the remaining weeks unlock as each one is finished and uploaded.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <span class="step-num">3</span>
      <p class="step-text"><strong>Your Toolkit is already live.</strong> No waiting for emails: <a href="https://thezerofog.com/app/" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">thezerofog.com/app/</a> - your Sleep Diary, Assessment, Protocol Card, and all three bonuses (<span class="accent-name">Your Caffeine Blueprint</span>, <span class="accent-name">9 Recovery Mistakes</span>, <span class="accent-name">The Recovery Protocol</span>) in one dashboard. Feel free to open it and look around. And don't worry about figuring anything out on your own - the welcome video kicks things off, and the app tour that follows shows you exactly how everything works, on desktop and on your phone. The same link lands in your welcome email too, so you can't lose it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="expectations">
    <h3>What To Expect Next</h3>
    <p><strong>This week:</strong> a welcome email with your login. Once you start Module 0, the system tracks where you are - so check-ins land at the right time, not too early or too late.</p>
    <p><strong>Across the four weeks:</strong> short emails when it's time to start a new week, a Day 0 assessment reminder before Week 1, and a Day 28 review when you finish.</p>
    <p><strong>Cadence:</strong> roughly one or two emails a week. No fluff. You can reply to any of them - they come straight to me.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="support-box">
    <p>Questions? Reply to the welcome email or write me direct. As a founding member, you have a direct line - we'll find the right pace together.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="disclaimer">This is an educational wellness program, not medical treatment. Results vary.</p>

